{"id": "q0435", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, there are several top NFL quarterback s, and it can depend on the season or how you measure success. Some of the most consistently great players include Patrick Ma hay, who's known for his accuracy and leadership; Josh All en, with his powerful arm and big-play ability; and Aaron Ro dgers, who is considered one of the greatest ever due to his consistency and clutch performance. Other elite names include Tom Brad y, though he retired recently, and guys like Jalen H urt or Jimmy Gar opolo who have also shown high levels of play in recent years. So while rankings might shift a bit from year to year, these guys are generally at the top of the list.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 35, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0447", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Yes, you can run Mac OS on a Windows PC. There are several ways to do this, but they all require some technical setup and may not work perfectly for everyone.One popular method is using virtual ization software like VMware Work stations or Parallels Desktop. These programs allow you to install a virtual machine on your Windows computer, which then runs Mac OS inside it. Another option is Boot Camp, which is built into Windows 1 0 and allows you to dual- boot with Mac OS if your hardware meets certain requirements.How ever, running Mac OS on a non-Mac device might have some performance limitations or compatibility issues with certain apps. It ’s also important to note that Apple does not officially support running Mac OS on non-Apple hardware, so there could be risks involved, such as security concerns or system instability. If you want to try it, make sure to back up your data first and proceed carefully.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 51, "carrier_ended": null}
